WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.930
Another cased daguerreotype
from the middle of the nineteenth century.

2
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:08.770
The stiff formality of early photography,
combined with studio habits,

3
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:13.560
makes the image feel frozen,
removed from time and from politics.

4
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:19.850
Studio photographers, and their customers,
prized regalia as the sign of Indianness.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.680
Everyday clothing,
which many Native men also wore by the 1840s,

6
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:25.950
rarely appears.
